WEBVTT

1
00:00.000 --> 00:05.000
Download the package for your browser from the Claritas website.

2
00:06.000 --> 00:11.000
Unzip it into a folder.

3
00:12.000 --> 00:21.000
On a Mac with Xcode, run ./build-safari.sh in the unzipped folder.

4
00:22.000 --> 00:29.000
Open Safari → Settings → Extensions.

5
00:30.000 --> 00:36.000
Turn on Claritas and allow it on websites.

6
00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
Open the Claritas popup from the toolbar.

7
00:42.000 --> 00:46.000
If Claritas is not listed, enable Develop → Allow Unsigned Extensions. We have not yet verified activation on real Safari.
